## Scripts (CRITICAL)

**NEVER** `systemctl start/restart/enable`
**NEVER** `pkill -f "universal-"` or `docker restart`/`docker stop` (bypasses lifecycle management)
**ONLY** `./manage` (TUI, human) or `manage` MCP tool (agent)

The agent MAY start, stop, restart, and rebuild services via `manage`.
Human-initiated operations: always via `./manage` (TUI).

## Commands

```bash
# Stop (human/emergency only — agents use manage)
pkill -f "universal-"; rm -f /tmp/universal-protocol/*.sock /tmp/process_ipc/*.sock

# Status
lsof -i:9998,9999
docker ps --format "table {{.Names}}\t{{.Status}}" | grep -E "mcp-server"
manage(action="status")  # agent: all managed services including host subprocesses

# Test inference
curl -X POST http://localhost:9999/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"model": "model-id", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hello"}]}'

# Event Service health
nc -U "${EVENTS_INGEST_SOCK:-/tmp/universal-protocol/events.sock}" < /dev/null && echo "ingest: ok"
scripts/query-events --op noise-profile --minutes 1

# MCP Server health
curl -sk https://<mcp-host>/health
```

## Service Deployment Model

| Service | Deployment | Managed by | Source library |
|---------|-----------|------------|----------------|
| Stargate | Host process | `./manage` | `services/universal-stargate/` |
| Gateway | Container (edge) | `./manage` | `services/_universal-llm-gateway/` |
| RAG | Host process | `./manage` | `services/rag/` |
| Cloud Proxy | Host subprocess | `./manage` | `services/universal_cloud_proxy/` |
| Event Service | Host subprocess | `./manage` | `libs/event_store/` |
| MCP Server | **Container** | `./manage` | `services/mcp-server/` |
| Cortex API | Host subprocess | `./manage` | `libs/cortex_store/` |
| Agent Bus | Host subprocess | `./manage` | `libs/agent_bus_store/` |
| Email Bridge | Host subprocess | `./manage` | external (`EMAIL_BRIDGE_ROOT`) |
| Git integration worker | Host uvicorn (TCP `:8091`) | `./manage` | `services/git_integration_worker/` |

All services are managed through `./manage`. There are no standalone/docker-compose-only services.

**Invariant**: default deployment uses `./manage` host subprocess lifecycle (PID files under `~/.gateway/`). Unit files under `services/*/systemd/` are optional operator-installed artifacts — ¬ the default ULG deploy shape. Agents must not instruct `systemctl` unless the operator explicitly runs that shape.

## Source-edit → Deploy action

∀ source file change: use this table. Do NOT infer the service from the tool/API surface — the MCP tools are served by the `mcp` container even when they call into the Cortex API.

| Changed files in | Service | Action |
|---|---|---|
| `libs/cortex_store/` | `cortex_api` | `manage(action="sync_restart", service="cortex_api")` |
| `libs/agent_bus_store/` | `agent_bus` | `manage(action="sync_restart", service="agent_bus")` |
| `libs/event_store/` | `event_service` | `manage(action="sync_restart", service="event_service")` |
| `services/mcp-server/` | `mcp` | `manage(action="sync_restart", service="mcp")` — cached source-sync (~20s); `rebuild mcp` is FORBIDDEN (full `--no-cache` is TUI-only: ./manage → Build Image) |
| `services/_universal-llm-gateway/` | `gateway` | `manage(action="sync_restart", service="gateway")` |
| `services/universal-stargate/` | `stargate` | `manage(action="sync_restart", service="stargate")` |
| `services/rag/` | `rag` | `manage(action="sync_restart", service="rag")` |
| `services/git_integration_worker/`, `libs/git_integrate/` | `git_integration_worker` | `manage(action="sync_restart", service="git_integration_worker")` |
| `libs/claude_bundles/`, `libs/cdp_ask/` | `cdp_ask` | `manage(action="sync_restart", service="cdp_ask")` — host satellite; CSE tabs survive; recover by `chat_url` (`restart-drain-discipline` § CSE vs service process). Never coupled to mcp |
| `services/mcp-server/tools/git_integrate.py` | `mcp` **and** `git_integration_worker` | MCP catalog relay + worker routes — restart **both** after land/diff tool changes |

**MCP container invariant**: `services/mcp-server/` is baked into `universal-mcp-server:local` at build time (`/app/services/mcp-server/`). The NFS bind mount `/mnt/torus/projects:/data/project` does **not** reach `/app/` — source edits are invisible to the running container until rebuilt. `sync_restart cortex_api` restarts only the Cortex API host subprocess; it has no effect on the MCP container.

```bash
# Health checks
curl -sf --unix-socket "${CORTEX_API_SOCK:-/tmp/universal-protocol/cortex-api.sock}" http://localhost/health
curl -sf --unix-socket "${AGENT_BUS_SOCK:-/tmp/universal-protocol/agent-bus.sock}" http://localhost/health
curl -sf --unix-socket "${EVENTS_INGEST_SOCK:-/tmp/universal-protocol/events.sock}" http://localhost/health 2>/dev/null || nc -U "${EVENTS_INGEST_SOCK:-/tmp/universal-protocol/events.sock}" < /dev/null && echo "ok"
```

